A log of creating an Operating System. Or at least, bits and pieces of an operating system.

HOW TO:
The OS includes a Makefile that, if exported, should run under the commands presuming the user is in the same folder that the makefile exists under:
make clean
make
make run

NOTE:
This current version will not compile correctly as it does not include the badapple.bin or the doom1.wad headers, this is intentional for copyright reasons. A later build will operate without these.
